  "term": "cannabis dependence",
  "definition": "Cannabis dependence is a dependent pattern of cannabis use in which the severity of dependence can vary among users. In the source, it is discussed as a common problem linked with cannabis use frequency and with some motives for use, especially coping and routine motives.",
